====== Cisco VEN401 ======


[[https://wikidevi.com/w/images/thumb/4/40/Cisco_VEN401_board_top.jpg/800px-Cisco_VEN401_board_top.jpg|Picture]]

The device is working and has been tested with Barrier Breaker 14.07.
See this [[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?id=54484|OpenWrt forum page]] for details and flashing instructions.

The v1.0 has the same hardware as the [[..:Linksys:E1000|Linksys E1000 v1]] and the [[..:Linksys:WRT160N|Linksys WRT160N v3.0]].

